      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently as-is, green does not make much sense to me as to why it is in the game. If I am switching from orange to green, why not just change to blue? I really want to be able to see before-hand who wants to join off me, but I also want people to be able to know where I am. Sure if I am in a large gathering somebody I may wanted to have curated might join off another person, but a situation like that wouldn't always be the case.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
