      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Functionally I'm not even sure if blue/green has a difference, and if they're supposed to it doesn't work. I used to always be on orange because I \"want people to knock\" but I still want to seem open to people actually being there. I just don't like surprises. \"Why are they on your friends list if you don't want them there?\" I get asked a lot. Do people not have different friend groups for different social settings and personalitities IRL? Let people see where I am so they can decided if it's worth knocking, and let me open the door, please!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
