      "value": "@{609a1fc2eeec070e82894e8d|full_name}: Difference between blue and green is that green is following world behavior, if you are in a private world, then green becomes that people need to request and so you will be notified, if you are on blue, the request will be automatically accepted and you’ll be joined without being notified yourself",
