      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62def40fd302ec44c0aaec2d|full_name}: At what point does the world become \"private\" though? I'm almost exclusively in Friends+ worlds, on green, and I find that I never need to accept requests; people can just join on me (functionally making it the same as blue). If I'm in Invite+ worlds, people have to send requests regardless. So is green only functionally significant in Friends worlds? That doesn't seem like how it should work. Or are we all using worlds wrong?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
