      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So much support for this. I'm always on orange because I want to be able to control who joins the instance. Some friends don't vibe with other friends, sometimes I only want to hang out with certain people, there's plenty of reasons for it. But there's almost never a reason for me to hide where I am and make people think I'm totally \"off limits\" for joining, I just want to be able to decline certain people if I need to.\n\nI'm not sure if replacing the current green status is the best way of going about it though, there is some value in having an \"auto accept if I'm in public/friends worlds but curate if I'm in a private world\" setting. A new status entirely would be the best of both worlds",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
