      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63ac3213dc63a1456881413d|full_name}: Agreed, I'm on green most of the time because I like the default behavior (anyone can join in friends+ without me having to accept a request, more-private instances get routed to me with a request).\n\nAdmittedly I'd go blue more often if I could create instances (including my home world) that are for only me with no invites, mostly because if I'm checking out worlds and didn't join the public then usually I don't necessarily want someone joining in without knocking first.",
