      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's amazing idea and I wish we had that\n\nHowever there's an issue\n\nFor Friends+ or Friends, if the user that is trying to join you, know the World and Instance ID, they can bypass requesting invite off of you by just finding that world, going into instance list and joining through there, completely bypassing any request to invite etc..",
